# SPEC GOLDEN — hand-derived from css-flexbox-1 §5.1 and §9.5 before the code
# existed. Never regenerated.
#
# `column-reverse` is the same flip `row-reverse` is, on the other axis:
# main-start is the container's **bottom** content edge, so an offset from
# main-start counts upwards and the first item in document order is the lowest
# one. Nothing else changes — §9.7 divided the same heights and §9.5 laid out
# the same offsets; only the mapping from a main-axis offset to a `y` is
# different. The box tree still lists the items in document order, which is why
# the `y` values below descend.
#
# Container 1 — `height: 96px` = 6 lines holding three 1-line items, so 3 lines
#   are free and `justify-content` is the initial `flex-start`: packed at
#   main-start, which is the bottom. Offsets from main-start are 0, 1, 2, and
#   the bottom content edge is y = 6, so the boxes land at 6−0−1 = 5, 6−1−1 = 4
#   and 6−2−1 = 3. The three blank rows are at the *top*.
#
# Container 2 — `height: auto`. The container is exactly as tall as its items
#   (3 lines), there is no free space, and reversal alone puts "one" at the
#   bottom: y = 8, 7, 6 inside a container at y = 6.
#
# Container 3 — the other edge. `justify-content: flex-end` packs at main-end,
#   which under `column-reverse` is the **top**: the 3 free lines move to the
#   bottom and the items sit at y = 11, 10, 9 in a container spanning 9..14.
#   Anchoring at an edge means anchoring at a *flex* edge, not at a physical
#   one — that is what makes this different from `justify-content` on a
#   plain column.
<html>  x=0 y=0 w=20 h=15
  <body>  x=0 y=0 w=20 h=15
    <div.col> flex column-reverse  x=0 y=0 w=20 h=6
      <div>  x=0 y=5 w=20 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=5 w=20 h=1
          line  x=0 y=5 w=20 h=1
            #text "one"  x=0 y=5 w=3 h=1
      <div>  x=0 y=4 w=20 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=4 w=20 h=1
          line  x=0 y=4 w=20 h=1
            #text "two"  x=0 y=4 w=3 h=1
      <div>  x=0 y=3 w=20 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=3 w=20 h=1
          line  x=0 y=3 w=20 h=1
            #text "three"  x=0 y=3 w=5 h=1
    <div.col.auto> flex column-reverse  x=0 y=6 w=20 h=3
      <div>  x=0 y=8 w=20 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=8 w=20 h=1
          line  x=0 y=8 w=20 h=1
            #text "one"  x=0 y=8 w=3 h=1
      <div>  x=0 y=7 w=20 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=7 w=20 h=1
          line  x=0 y=7 w=20 h=1
            #text "two"  x=0 y=7 w=3 h=1
      <div>  x=0 y=6 w=20 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=6 w=20 h=1
          line  x=0 y=6 w=20 h=1
            #text "three"  x=0 y=6 w=5 h=1
    <div.col.top> flex column-reverse  x=0 y=9 w=20 h=6
      <div>  x=0 y=11 w=20 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=11 w=20 h=1
          line  x=0 y=11 w=20 h=1
            #text "one"  x=0 y=11 w=3 h=1
      <div>  x=0 y=10 w=20 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=10 w=20 h=1
          line  x=0 y=10 w=20 h=1
            #text "two"  x=0 y=10 w=3 h=1
      <div>  x=0 y=9 w=20 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=9 w=20 h=1
          line  x=0 y=9 w=20 h=1
            #text "three"  x=0 y=9 w=5 h=1
